WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.768
-Higgins, the craziest thing
happened to me this morning.

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.037
-What?
-I was walking to work,

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:06.539
and I was walking, probably
around 29th street.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:07.573
I just started --

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:09.843
[ Phone ringing ]

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.411
The red phone's ringing.
Sorry.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:13.846
Someone's trying
to FaceTime me.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:16.215
[ Phone ringing ]

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.684
It's Dwayne Johnson.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.751
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.320
Should I -- Should I pick up?

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.055
-Got to pick up.

00:00:23.055 --> 00:00:25.158
-Dwayne?

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:29.162
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.864
-Hey there, buddy.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.298
-[ Laughs ]
What's up, buddy?

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.300
-Oh, man.
Hey, look, Jimmy.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.902
I know you're right in the
middle of shooting your show

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:39.272
and -- hey, what's up audience?
How you guys doing?

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.573
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.308
-Yeah.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.576
-Dude, I know you're
right in the middle

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:46.179
of shooting your show,
but I just got some news.

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:47.813
I'm here working out in
The Iron Paradise, too.

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.248
But I just got some news.

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:51.584
It's critical news, and I just
had to share it with you.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.786
-What's up?
-All right.

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:56.823
Well, I was just told that
the Christmas gift I got you

00:00:56.823 --> 00:01:01.060
last month, finally arrived
and it's there in your studio.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.561
It's right behind the curtain,

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:04.330
and I think you should
look at it.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.398
-Where is it?

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:09.335
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:12.272
Oh, yeah. Uh...

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.373
I have no idea --
What is it?

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:20.246
-Well, that is a 250-pound rock
from "The Rock."

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:22.315
-Hey, I get it.
Wow.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:24.417
-Okay, but that's not
just the good news.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.984
All right. You're thinking,
"Wow, dreams come true."

00:01:25.984 --> 00:01:27.887
But hold on a second.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.355
-I wasn't thinking that at all.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.290
-That rock comes from my NBC hit
show called "The Titan Games,"

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.659
where we have very
inspiring people

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:37.564
doing really epic, incredibly
athletic competitions

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.599
and competitive events
on television.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.367
The greatest you've ever seen.
-Yeah.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.403
-Now, I thought since that rock
weighs 250 pounds

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:46.439
and well -- that one does --
I weigh 260.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.208
But who's counting?

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.809
-Clearly you are.
You're the one who said it.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:52.845
-You have sent over
250 e-mails, 250 texts,

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:55.281
250 voicemails talking about
how you want to get

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:57.650
in the best shape
of your life in 2019.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.086
I thought, "You know what?
I got an idea."

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.455
Christmas gift would drop
from "Dwayntaclaus."

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:05.257
So, I think right here --
-"Dwayntaclaus."

00:02:05.257 --> 00:02:07.093
-Right now on your show,
you take

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.995
"The Titan Games" challenge.

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:12.532
-No, I don't want to.
Not right now.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:15.201
No, no. Dwayne.
I love "Titan Games."

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.570
I love the show, and thank you
for thinking of me,

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.104
but it's not gonna happen.
I cannot --

00:02:19.104 --> 00:02:21.574
I cannot move a 250-pound rock.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.242
[ Audience "Aw"s ]

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:25.778
-Wait a second. Wait a minute.
Wait a minute. Wait.

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.679
All you got to do, dude --
all you got to do --

00:02:27.679 --> 00:02:30.115
I want you take
that 250 pound --

00:02:30.115 --> 00:02:31.651
-No, I don't know.
-I just want you to drag it

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.820
across the studio.
You can do it.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.655
I think you can do it,
the world thinks you can do it,

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.556
and the audience thinks
you can do it.

00:02:37.556 --> 00:02:41.227
Jimmy. Jimmy. Jimmy.
Jimmy. Jimmy. Jimmy.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:45.831
[ Crowd chants "Jimmy" ]

00:02:45.831 --> 00:02:47.633
-So embarrassing.

00:02:47.633 --> 00:02:50.970
♪♪

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.873
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:57.109
♪♪

00:02:57.109 --> 00:03:00.079
-Come on, dude.

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:02.014
Yes.

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:04.950
Put your muscles into it.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:09.054
Put your glutes into it.

00:03:09.054 --> 00:03:11.724
-Oh!

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:14.994
-Oh, man.

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:17.029
-Come on, Jimmy.
Come on, Jimmy.

00:03:17.029 --> 00:03:19.565
Jimmy. Jimmy. Jimmy.

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:24.237
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:26.505
-Oh, man.
-Hey, you know what, dude?

00:03:26.505 --> 00:03:28.107
You know what, Jimmy.
-Yeah.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:31.377
-I am so sorry. You know,
I love and respect you man.

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:33.145
I didn't mean to put you on the
spot, but -- you know what?

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:34.480
You need a little bit of help.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.349
My man Higgins, Tariq,
please come and help Jimmy

00:03:37.349 --> 00:03:38.751
drag that rock.

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:42.721
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:42.721 --> 00:03:44.323
-You get in there first.

00:03:44.323 --> 00:03:48.394
♪♪

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:50.229
-Grab the chain.
-What?

00:03:50.229 --> 00:03:51.864
-Grab the -- no, no.
The chain!

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.199
-Oh, like that?

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.167
-What's wrong with you?
One, two, three.

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:57.937
-You got it, boys.
-Let's go.

00:03:57.937 --> 00:03:59.772
-That was easy, we did it.

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:01.074
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:02.908
That was easy.
-Hey, buddy.

00:04:02.908 --> 00:04:04.310
-That's how it's done.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.746
-That was it.
That was it, right there.

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:09.148
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:11.049
-Dwayne...

00:04:11.049 --> 00:04:13.151
Dwayne, we did it, buddy.

00:04:13.151 --> 00:04:16.956
Uh, now -- now what -- now what
do I do with this thing?

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:18.324
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:19.825
-Oh, uh, you know what?

00:04:19.825 --> 00:04:22.528
I have no idea. It's up to you.
Merry Christmas.

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:24.330
Love you brother.
Bye.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.432
-Oh, my God.

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.500
A rock -- A 250-pound rock
from "The Rock."

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.804
Dwayne Johnson, everybody.
Love that guy.

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:36.075
Check out "The Titan Games"
Thursdays at 8:00 P.M. on NBC.

